
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Field Study E-Portfolio</title>
<style>
:root {
  --gold: #b3975b;
  --cream: #faf7f0;
  --ink: #39352e;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: Georgia, serif;
  line-height: 1.8;
}
nav {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  background: #fffdf8;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #dfd0ad;
  padding: 14px 5%;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 18px;
  z-index: 5;
}
nav a {
  color: var(--ink);
  text-decoration: none;
  font: 12px Arial, sans-serif;
}
nav a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
.hero {
  min-height: 80vh;
  margin: 24px;
  padding: 65px 20px;
  border: 3px double var(--gold);
  outline: 1px solid #dfd0ad;
  outline-offset: -12px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
}
.eyebrow {
  color: var(--gold);
  letter-spacing: 4px;
  font: 11px Arial, sans-serif;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
h1 { font-size: clamp(35px, 7vw, 66px); line-height: 1.2; }
h2 { font-size: 30px; font-weight: normal; }
h3 { color: #8e7542; }
.subtitle { max-width: 600px; }
.portrait {
  width: 130px;
  height: 160px;
  border: 1px solid var(--gold);
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  background: #f0e8d8;
  color: #776748;
  font: 12px Arial, sans-serif;
  margin: 20px;
}
section {
  max-width: 950px;
  margin: auto;
  padding: 65px 24px;
  scroll-margin-top: 65px;
}
.section-label {
  color: var(--gold);
  font: 11px Arial, sans-serif;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
}
.card {
  background: #fffdf8;
  border: 1px solid #e4dac5;
  padding: 24px;
  margin: 16px 0;
}
.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
  gap: 16px;
}
.button {
  display: inline-block;
  border: 1px solid var(--gold);
  padding: 10px 20px;
  color: var(--ink);
  text-decoration: none;
  margin-top: 12px;
}
footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 30px;
  border-top: 1px solid #dfd0ad;
  font-size: 13px;
}
.placeholder { color: #8b8170; font-style: italic; }
hr { border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #e4dac5; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <a href="#home">HOME</a>
  <a href="#profile">PROFILE</a>
  <a href="#goals">LEARNING GOALS</a>
  <a href="#school">SCHOOL</a>
  <a href="#weekly">WEEKLY JOURNAL</a>
  <a href="#activities">ACTIVITIES</a>
  <a href="#growth">ACTION PLAN</a>
  <a href="#appendices">APPENDICES</a>
</nav>

<header class="hero" id="home">
  <p class="eyebrow">Teacher Education • Digital Portfolio</p>
  <div class="portrait">YOUR PHOTO</div>
  <h1>My Field Study<br>E-Portfolio</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Field Study 1 and Field Study 2</p>
  <p>Classroom Observations • Teaching Experiences • Professional Growth</p>
  <p class="placeholder">Your Name | Academic Year</p>
  <a class="button" href="#introduction">Explore My Portfolio</a>
</header>

<section id="introduction">
  <p class="section-label">01 / INTRODUCTION</p>
  <h2>Welcome to My Portfolio</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <p>This portfolio documents my learning experiences, classroom observations, participation, reflections, and professional development throughout Field Study 1 and Field Study 2. It reflects my growth as a future educator and my commitment to creating meaningful learning experiences for students.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="profile">
  <p class="section-label">02 / STUDENT PROFILE</p>
  <h2>About Me</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>Personal Information</h3>
    <p><b>Full Name:</b> <span class="placeholder">Your full name</span></p>
    <p><b>Student Number:</b> <span class="placeholder">Your student number</span></p>
    <p><b>Program and Major:</b> BSEd Major in Science</p>
    <p><b>Academic Year:</b> <span class="placeholder">Academic year</span></p>
    <p><b>Course Code and Title:</b> <span class="placeholder">Enter course details</span></p>
    <p><b>Field Study Adviser:</b> <span class="placeholder">Adviser's name</span></p>
    <p><b>Cooperating School:</b> Taguig National High School</p>
    <p><b>Cooperating Teacher:</b> <span class="placeholder">Teacher's name</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>Brief Biography</h3>
    <p class="placeholder">Write a short biography about yourself, your educational background, interests, and aspirations as a future Science teacher.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>Personal Educational Philosophy</h3>
    <p class="placeholder">Explain your beliefs about teaching, learning, student participation, and the role of a teacher.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>Career Objectives</h3>
    <p class="placeholder">Describe your professional goals and the kind of educator you aspire to become.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>Curriculum Vitae</h3>
    <p class="placeholder">Add your CV PDF link here when ready.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="goals">
  <p class="section-label">03 / LEARNING GOALS</p>
  <h2>My Learning Goals</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Field Study 1</h3>
      <p class="placeholder">Describe your expectations and goals for classroom observation, understanding learners, and analyzing the teaching-learning environment.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Field Study 2</h3>
      <p class="placeholder">Describe your goals for participating in classroom activities, assisting your cooperating teacher, and developing teaching skills.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="school">
  <p class="section-label">04 / COOPERATING SCHOOL</p>
  <h2>School Profile</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>School Overview</h3>
    <p class="placeholder">Add the school's background, location, history, and educational programs.</p>
    <h3>Vision</h3>
    <p class="placeholder">Insert the school's official vision.</p>
    <h3>Mission</h3>
    <p class="placeholder">Insert the school's official mission.</p>
    <h3>Core Values</h3>
    <p class="placeholder">Insert the school's official core values.</p>
    <h3>Organizational Structure</h3>
    <p class="placeholder">Add the approved organizational chart or description.</p>
    <h3>School Facilities</h3>
    <p class="placeholder">Add descriptions and permitted photographs of school facilities.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="weekly">
  <p class="section-label">05 / WEEKLY DOCUMENTATION</p>
  <h2>My Weekly Journal</h2>
  <p>Each entry records my experiences, learning evidence, and reflections throughout my field study.</p>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>Week 1 — <span class="placeholder">Date</span></h3>
    <p><b>Learning Objectives</b></p>
    <p class="placeholder">What did I aim to learn?</p>
    <p><b>Classroom Observations — FS1</b></p>
    <p class="placeholder">Describe the classroom environment, learners, and teaching strategies observed.</p>
    <p><b>Participation and Assigned Tasks — FS2</b></p>
    <p class="placeholder">Describe the tasks performed and your participation.</p>
    <p><b>Learning Evidence and Photo Documentation</b></p>
    <p class="placeholder">Add permitted photographs, captions, and supporting evidence.</p>
    <p><b>Weekly Reflection</b></p>
    <p class="placeholder">What did I learn? What challenges did I encounter? How can I improve?</p>
  </div>
  <p class="placeholder">Duplicate the Week 1 entry for every succeeding week and update its content.</p>
</section>

<section id="activities">
  <p class="section-label">06 / PROFESSIONAL DEVELOPMENT</p>
  <h2>Activities and Achievements</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <h3 class="placeholder">Title of Activity</h3>
    <p><b>Date:</b> <span class="placeholder">Activity date</span></p>
    <p><b>Description:</b> <span class="placeholder">Describe the seminar, webinar, workshop, or institutional activity.</span></p>
    <p><b>Reflection:</b> <span class="placeholder">Explain what you learned and how it contributes to your professional growth.</span></p>
    <p><b>Photo Documentation and Certificates:</b></p>
    <p class="placeholder">Add permitted photos and certificate links.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="growth">
  <p class="section-label">07 / PROFESSIONAL GROWTH</p>
  <h2>My Action Plan</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <p><b>Area for Improvement:</b> <span class="placeholder">Identify a teaching skill to improve.</span></p>
    <p><b>Action Plan:</b> <span class="placeholder">List specific steps you will take.</span></p>
    <p><b>Timeline:</b> <span class="placeholder">Set a target period.</span></p>
    <p><b>Expected Outcome:</b> <span class="placeholder">Describe the improvement you expect to achieve.</span></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="appendices">
  <p class="section-label">08 / APPENDICES</p>
  <h2>Supporting Documents</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <ul>
      <li>Observation Forms</li>
      <li>Attendance Records</li>
      <li>Permitted School Forms</li>
      <li>Endorsement or Acceptance Letter</li>
      <li>Approved Class or Observation Schedule</li>
      <li>Observation Notes or Field Notes</li>
      <li>Feedback or Evaluation Forms</li>
      <li>Applicable Consent Forms</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="placeholder">Add links to documents approved for sharing.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <p>FIELD STUDY 1 & FIELD STUDY 2</p>
  <p>Teaching, Learning, and Professional Growth</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
